            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say hice, hiciste, hizo. These are strong, stem-stressed forms with no written accents. Hizo is an irregular stem alternation inside this family; it is not a general rule that c must become z before o. Reuse known café:"
            },
            {
